            "notes": "## Powers\n\nEarly game we abuse [Hidden Blade](item_a820416d-85e5-4018-b20a-dc1cbf744900) for healing it gives for landing melees. This is great for earning cash and trading with a lot of heroes like Moira and outright kills others like Soldier. It also makes your blades consistently better throughout the entire game, because they have tons of lifesteal now.\n\n## Items\n\n[Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) for more cash and lifesteal, [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for damage and plasma converter for a bit of lifesteal, [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) is just as good though.",
