            "notes": "Spam green HP items because we only need [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a).\n\nIf you have more cash, [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) are the only other items I like this early on for non-counterpick items.\n\nIf you have cash left:\n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) now has 5% movement speed and is cheaper, making it good enough vs heroes who like to headshot, like Cass, Ashe, Zen, Kiri, or Soldier.\n- [Anti-Beam Coating](item_1ab73e1c-aaa1-4026-89cd-68404db7fd93) is a must vs Zarya in most games. It's still useful vs Mei, Moira, and Winton.",
