            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Cybernetic Speed](item_6e88739f-7e7e-4e01-ba55-2e3c62c949ec) is just free attack speed and generally good. It's very noticeable when you have all stacks up.\n\n[Sacred Shuriken](item_b32b34a9-0163-4092-875e-3a9817b7df54) is great if you can farm the enemies because they stack or have an easy to shoot tank. Then you get a lot of cash of that.\n\n## Items\n\n[Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) is the highest damage for cash, and the armor effect is useful since Genji shoots quite low-damage projectiles.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is useful for farming the 100 HP before the engage to give you a strong duel or engage.\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is great for poking and has a bit more HP. This is good against heroes like Rein, DVA, or Sigma who can't quite sustain the poke yet\u2014whenever there are easy-to-shoot targets, really.\n\nIf you have a lot of money, you should just outright buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b).",
