            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Sacred Shuriken](item_b32b34a9-0163-4092-875e-3a9817b7df54) for more poke\u2014great if there are easy-to-shoot tanks. This is so much damage that people sometimes outright die from 1\u20132 left-clicks if they headshot. Get into the habit of left-clicking more, even if you are quite close to them\u2014only right-click if you are point blank. This will farm money as well.\n\n[Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) is good if there are squishy targets that die fast, like Ashe or Zen, where you have to be more like an assassin.\n\n## Items\n\nAnother epic item\u2014usually I take [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) because it helps with attack speed and has a bit of HP. Again, if you can buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), you NEED to replace one of the purple items if you have enough cash.\n\nThis is also the first round where I would consider buying a defensive item like [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is similar but cheaper and a bit more attack.",
