        {
            "id": "76008e54-7db8-4189-987e-fd5ba7123656",
            "build_id": "af20c657-7def-4b38-b8d0-7af520033529",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-02T17:28:31.252339+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Forged Under Fire](item_b60b1aa3-e69d-4d19-b3d8-43de1cce110c) is usually my favorite because it can heal half your HP at times.\n\n[Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) if you need more damage to kill squishy targets or you aren't under pressure.\n\n## Items\n\nIn most games, you need [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a), and [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) for the core damage. This round you also need to get a defensive item because there's just not enough useful items anymore. Usually I take  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).\n\nThen we get to the last item, which would replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you still have the money for it (if there's no armor on the enemy team, you can also sell Codebreaker instead\u2014maybe it opens up another epic item):\n\n- [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) is obviously better in every way but also more costly.\n- [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is slightly more HP but might help to not get blown up instantly.\n- Divine Intervention is very powerful against burst that deals 150 damage or more in singular hits.\n- [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is almost always gonna get you to 15\u201320% WP since you use dash, and then it's got 10% CDR on top, which is usable.\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) has 25 more HP.",
